dxil-spirv (vkd3d-proton subproject): AttributeAtVertex vertex index at 32 bits

HLSL GetAttributeAtVertex (SM 6.1, DXIL dx.op.attributeAtVertex) passes its
VertexID as an i8 constant.  emit_load_input_instruction() looked the index
up without a forced width, and get_id_for_constant() has no 8-bit case, so
the constant resolved to SPIR-V ID 0 and that 0 was cached in value_map.
LLVM uniques constants, so the column index of the same access chain (the
same i8 0/1/2, looked up later with width 32) hit the poisoned cache entry as
well: every OpAccessChain into the PerVertexKHR input had index ID 0
(spirv-val "Id is 0"), SPIRV-Cross emitted an undeclared `_0`, and every PSO
with GetAttributeAtVertex failed with VK_ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED
(fullstack-hub/anyos#936).  The vertex index is now looked up at 32 bits.

Backport of upstream dxil-spirv 263a8cd54006c85499debd04eb426ddd8a1477b1
("Force 32-bit width for AttributeAtVertex vertex index", 2026-10-26; code
hunk only, without its reference shader).  Drop this patch when the
vkd3d-proton pin includes that commit.  VKD3D_ANYOS_SHADER_REVISION is bumped
so guests drop pipelines cached with the old SPIR-V.

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/cache.c b/libs/vkd3d/cache.c
index 3a77f02..7e63fa5 100644
--- a/libs/vkd3d/cache.c
+++ b/libs/vkd3d/cache.c
@@ -27,9 +27,9 @@
  * a guest kept the old, wrong code across a tools update. Bump this with
  * every patch that changes compiled shaders. */
 #if defined(ANYOS_SW_ABI31_REDUCED_PROFILE) && ANYOS_SW_ABI31_REDUCED_PROFILE
-#define VKD3D_ANYOS_SHADER_REVISION 31 /* private SM6.6 compute and reduced-capability profile */
+#define VKD3D_ANYOS_SHADER_REVISION 32 /* 32: reduced profile with AttributeAtVertex vertex index (dxil-spirv 0335) */
 #else
-#define VKD3D_ANYOS_SHADER_REVISION 4 /* 4: integration2 SF, sample positions and real FP32 float controls */
+#define VKD3D_ANYOS_SHADER_REVISION 5 /* 5: AttributeAtVertex vertex index (dxil-spirv 0335) */
 #endif
 #define VKD3D_ANYOS_BUILD (vkd3d_build ^ (VKD3D_ANYOS_SHADER_REVISION * UINT64_C(0x9e3779b97f4a7c15)))
 
diff --git a/subprojects/dxil-spirv/opcodes/dxil/dxil_resources.cpp b/subprojects/dxil-spirv/opcodes/dxil/dxil_resources.cpp
index 082fab1..6b879aa 100644
--- a/subprojects/dxil-spirv/opcodes/dxil/dxil_resources.cpp
+++ b/subprojects/dxil-spirv/opcodes/dxil/dxil_resources.cpp
@@ -240,7 +240,11 @@ bool emit_load_input_instruction(Converter::Impl &impl, const llvm::CallInst *in
 				op->add_id(builder.makeUintConstant(0));
 			}
 			else
-				op->add_id(impl.get_id_for_value(index));
+			{
+				// AttributeAtVertex's VertexID is i8. Without a forced width, i8 constants
+				// have no SPIR-V type and resolve to ID 0, which also poisons value_map.
+				op->add_id(impl.get_id_for_value(index, 32));
+			}
 		}
 		if (row_index)
 			op->add_id(impl.get_id_for_value(instruction->getOperand(2)));
